---
# The raw layer, the one place sqlearn's C++ owns raw memory (ADR 0065):
# every check of engine/.clang-tidy but the two families that forbid what
# this layer is for, pointer arithmetic and bounds (a Buffer pairs its
# pointer with its count) and reinterpret_cast (memory as bytes).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-*,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast
